        "id": "cmv6we91f0000l208aynfjqs1",
        "name": "IMP - 002",
        "slug": "imp-002",
        "description": "Upgrade your everyday wardrobe with our Premium Men's Smart-Casual Trousers. Designed to deliver a sleek, modern aesthetic, these versatile pants effortlessly bridge the gap between professional office wear and elevated evening style. Crafted from a smooth, high-quality fabric blend, they provide a sharp, tailored look while keeping you comfortable throughout the day.\n\nAvailable in essential, easy-to-pair shades like Classic Navy Blue and Timeless Black, these trousers are the perfect foundation for any outfit—whether paired with a crisp button-down shirt or a relaxed polo.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nModern Tailored Fit: Cut for a sharp, streamlined silhouette that provides a clean and flattering profile without compromising on comfort.\nRefined Detailing: Features a classic flat-front design, a secure button and zip-fly closure, and deep, functional slant side pockets.\nSignature Accents: Elevated with exclusive design touches, including a subtle triangular metallic charm near the belt loop and a premium branded patch detail just below the waistband.\nAll-Day Comfort: The smooth, durable fabric ensures a structured look that resists wrinkling, keeping you looking polished from morning meetings to after-hours dinners.",
        "careInstructions": "To maintain the fabric's premium feel, color, and structural integrity, please follow these care guidelines strictly:\n\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Machine wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand wash with harsh scrubbing, and do not dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will damage the fabric and synthetic fibers. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron, or use a gentle garment steamer.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade. Do not tumble dry.",
