        "id": "cmv6wz6ai0000s4qk30rp49o9",
        "name": "IMP - 003",
        "slug": "imp-003",
        "description": "Classic Tailoring Meets Modern Sophistication\nElevate your everyday attire with our Premium Pleated Smart-Casual Trousers. Masterfully blending vintage-inspired tailoring with a sleek, contemporary silhouette, these pants are designed for the modern man who values both style and comfort. Featuring a sophisticated single-pleat front, they offer a relaxed feel around the hips while maintaining a sharp, structured look down the leg.\n\nAvailable in deep, versatile dark tones (like rich Navy and classic Black), these trousers are the ultimate anchor piece for your wardrobe—seamlessly transitioning from important office meetings to upscale weekend dinners.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\n⚬ Signature Pleated Front: The elegant single-pleat design not only adds a touch of classic refinement but also provides extra room and mobility for all-day comfort.\n⚬ Modern Tapered Fit: Expertly tailored to taper gently toward the ankle, delivering a sharp, clean profile that pairs perfectly with loafers, oxfords, or even smart sneakers.\n⚬ Premium Detailing: Finished with a secure button-and-zip fly closure, sturdy belt loops, and deep slant side pockets.\n⚬ Exclusive Accents: Accented with a distinctive, subtle metallic charm near the left pocket for an elevated, designer finish.\n⚬ Smooth & Structured Fabric: Crafted from a high-quality blend that drapes beautifully and resists wrinkling, ensuring you look polished from morning till night.",
        "careInstructions": "To preserve the fabric's smooth finish, structure, and color depth, please adhere strictly to the following care guidelines:\n\n⚬ WASHING MACHINE ONLY: Machine wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand scrub harshly, and do not dry clean.\n⚬ NO HOT IRONING: High heat will permanently damage the fabric and alter the tailored pleat. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron, or gently steam the garment.\n⚬ Drying: Line dry in the shade to maintain the integrity of the fabric. Do not tumble dry.",
