    "description": "Elevate your everyday attire with our Premium Smart-Casual Trousers. Designed for the discerning gentleman, these pants feature a sophisticated self-structure fabric that adds subtle depth, character, and a luxurious feel to your look. Whether you are heading to a business meeting, a smart-casual office, or an evening out, these trousers provide a polished aesthetic without compromising on comfort.\nAvailable in an extensive palette of eight versatile colors—including Light Beige, Chocolate Brown, Slate Blue, Medium Grey, Deep Navy, Olive Green, Ice Grey, and Classic Black—you can easily build a complete wardrobe ready for any occasion.\n\nProduct Highlights:\nDistinctive Self-Structure: Crafted from a premium fabric with a subtle woven self-structure, giving the trousers a high-end, tactile finish that sets them apart from basic solids.\nModern Tailored Fit: Cut with a clean, flat-front design that tapers beautifully down the leg, offering a sharp, modern silhouette.\nElegant Detailing: Features a premium button closure, secure belt loops, deep slant side pockets, and a sleek metallic rivet accent near the front pocket.\nAll-Day Comfort & Drape: The textured fabric blend provides a structured yet flexible fit that resists wrinkling, keeping you looking sharp from morning to night.",
    "careInstructions": "To maintain the distinctive self-structure, fabric integrity, and color depth, please adhere strictly to these care guidelines:\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand wash with abrasive scrubbing and do not dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will permanently flatten the fabric's self-structure and damage the synthetic fibers. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron, or gently steam the garment.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade. Do not tumble dry on high heat.",
