    "name": "IMP - 005",
    "slug": "imp-005",
    "description": "Elevate your wardrobe with our versatile Men’s Slim-Fit Trousers, the perfect blend of casual sophistication and workday readiness. Offered in a premium range of versatile, easy-to-pair shades—including Navy Blue, Dark Grey, Classic Black, Cream/Beige, and Olive Green—these pants are designed to keep you looking sharp and feeling comfortable from your morning commute to after-hours gatherings.\n\nProduct Highlights:\nFabric & Fit: Tailored from a high-quality, stretch-blend fabric that offers excellent shape retention, breathability, and all-day comfort. Featuring a modern slim-fit cut that tapers gently down the leg for a sleek, contemporary silhouette.\nSignature Styling: Designed with a structured waistband, belt loops, a standard zip fly, and an elegant, metallic-accented button closure.\nFunctional Pockets: Features deep side pockets and classic buttonless rear welt pockets, perfect for securing your essentials without adding bulk.\nFinishing Touches: Includes a subtle, stylish brand label on the waistband/pocket area, adding a touch of modern detail.",
