    "name": "IMP - 006",
    "slug": "imp-006",
    "description": "Elevate your everyday look with our Premium Men's Flat-Front Trousers. Designed for effortless transitions between the office, smart-casual events, and weekend outings, these trousers offer a clean, sophisticated aesthetic without compromising on comfort. Crafted from a smooth, high-quality fabric, they provide a structured yet flexible fit that keeps you looking sharp all day long.\n\nAvailable in three essential, deep tones—Slate Grey, Olive Green, and Midnight Black—these pants are the perfect foundation for pairing with crisp shirts, knits, or casual tees.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nModern Tailored Fit: Cut for a sleek, contemporary silhouette that tapers cleanly down the leg, offering a sharp profile that flatters your shape.\nClassic Flat-Front Design: Features a smooth front with a prominent, stylish button closure and secure zip fly for a polished look.\nPremium Accents: Finished with functional slant side pockets and elevated with a subtle, geometric metallic charm detail near the left pocket.\nAll-Day Comfort: The durable, easy-drape fabric ensures a structured appearance that resists wrinkling, providing comfortable wear from morning to night.",
    "careInstructions": "WASHING MACHINE ONLY: Machine wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand wash with abrasive scrubbing, and do not dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will damage the fabric's smooth finish. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron, or gently steam the garment.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade to preserve color depth and fabric integrity. Do not tumble dry.",
