    "name": "IMP - 007",
    "slug": "imp-007",
    "description": "Upgrade your wardrobe essentials with our Premium Men's Smart Trousers. Masterfully designed to offer a flawless balance of formal elegance and everyday comfort, these pants are your new go-to for office days, weekend events, and everything in between.\nCrafted from a smooth, high-quality fabric that drapes perfectly, these trousers feature a sleek, modern fit. What truly sets them apart is the exclusive detailing—a striking metallic crest accent on the belt loop and a patterned inner waistband that speaks to premium craftsmanship.\n\nAvailable in a versatile six-color palette—Slate Grey, Charcoal, Sand/Beige, Deep Navy, Olive Green, and Classic Black—you can easily build a complete, sophisticated wardrobe.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nSignature Metallic Hardware: Elevated with a distinctive metallic crest accent on the front belt loop and a sleek triangular pocket charm for a high-end designer finish.\nRefined Tailoring: Features a subtle front dart/pleat for a structured, comfortable fit around the hips that tapers cleanly down the leg.\nHidden Details: Designed with a stylish, patterned inner waistband lining that adds a hidden touch of luxury.\nFunctional Design: Complete with deep slant side pockets, secure belt loops, and a smooth zip-fly closure.\nAll-Day Wearability: The premium fabric blend offers a crisp, wrinkle-resistant look that keeps you comfortable and looking sharp from morning to night.",
    "careInstructions": "To protect the premium fabric, metallic hardware, and structured fit, please adhere strictly to the following care guidelines:\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Machine wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand scrub or dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will permanently damage the fabric's smooth finish and synthetic fibers. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron, or use a gentle garment steamer.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade to maintain color vibrancy and fabric integrity. Do not tumble dry.",
