    "name": "IMP - 010",
    "slug": "imp-010",
    "description": "Elevate your essential wardrobe with our Premium Tailored Smart-Casual Trousers (Style: IMP-010). Designed for impeccable versatility, these trousers offer a clean, flat-front silhouette that transitions seamlessly from the boardroom to evening engagements. Crafted from a smooth, premium fabric blend, they provide a structured, polished look while ensuring comfortable all-day wear.\n\nThese pants are the perfect foundation for pairing with crisp dress shirts, casual knits, or tailored blazers.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nModern Tailored Fit: Features a clean, flat-front design that tapers perfectly for a sharp, streamlined profile.\nPremium Hardware: Elevated with a distinctive metallic button closure and a subtle triangular metallic charm near the front pocket.\nHidden Luxury Details: Designed with a sophisticated striped pattern lining the inner waistband for a touch of hidden designer craftsmanship.\nVersatile Styling: Equipped with standard belt loops and smooth, slant side pockets, balancing formal aesthetics with everyday functionality.",
    "careInstructions": "To maintain the premium finish, structured fit, and color depth of these trousers, please adhere strictly to the following care guidelines:\n\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand scrub harshly or dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will permanently damage the smooth finish of the fabric and any synthetic blends. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron, or use a gentle garment steamer.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade to preserve the fabric's integrity and color. Do not tumble dry on high heat.",
