    "name": "IMP - 012",
    "slug": "imp-012",
    "description": "Upgrade your wardrobe with our Premium Men's Smart-Casual Trousers, designed to deliver a polished, modern aesthetic. Featuring a clean, smooth-finish fabric, these trousers are perfect for the gentleman who prefers a sharp, solid look without added textures or patterns. Whether you are leading a presentation in the boardroom or attending a refined evening event, these pants offer an impeccable balance of comfort and formal elegance.\n\nAvailable in core, high-impact colors including Classic Black and Vibrant Navy Blue, they serve as the ultimate versatile foundation for your outfits.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nSmooth Premium Fabric: Crafted from a high-quality blend with a sleek, solid finish that drapes flawlessly and resists wrinkling.\nModern Tailored Fit: The clean, flat-front design features a contemporary tapered cut that flatters your profile while maintaining all-day comfort.\nExclusive Designer Accents: Elevated with unique metallic hardware, including a horizontal brand tag on the right side and a sleek triangular charm near the left pocket.\nFunctional Elegance: Designed with sturdy belt loops, a secure button closure, and deep slant side pockets for everyday practicality.",
    "careInstructions": "To protect the premium smooth finish, metallic hardware, and fabric integrity, please adhere strictly to these care guidelines:\n\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Machine wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand wash with abrasive scrubbing, and do not dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will permanently damage the fabric's smooth finish and synthetic blends. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron, or use a gentle garment steamer.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade to preserve the deep colors and structural fit. Do not tumble dry on high heat.",
