    "name": "IMP-001",
    "slug": "imp001",
    "description": "Elevate your smart-casual and professional wardrobe with our Premium Micro-Pattern Trousers (Style: IMP-001). Featuring a refined, subtly textured micro-check design, these trousers offer a stylish alternative to standard solid colors while remaining versatile enough for the office or evening events.\n\nTailored in a contemporary Narrow Fit, they provide a sharp, streamlined silhouette that flatters your profile. Finished with classic details, including a button-closure rear pocket and a subtle premium brand patch, these trousers are designed to make a quiet statement of quality.\n\nProduct Highlights:\nDistinctive Fabric: Crafted with a sophisticated micro-pattern/dotted texture that adds depth and character to your look.\n\nModern Tailoring: The Narrow Fit ensures a clean, tapered look that pairs perfectly with both dress shoes and smart sneakers.\n\nRefined Details: Features standard belt loops, a flat-front design, secure button-fastened rear pockets, and a signature brand patch.\n\nColor Options: Available in versatile, easy-to-style shades including classic Grey Black and deep Grey Navy Blue.",
    "careInstructions": "To maintain the unique texture and fit of these trousers, please adhere strictly to the following care guidelines:\n\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand scrub or dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will damage the fabric. If necessary, use a cool/low-temperature iron only, or a gentle garment steamer.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade. Do not tumble dry.",
