    "id": "cmv71j9oa0000suuwbsgre95g",
    "name": "IMP - 008",
    "slug": "imp-008",
    "description": "The Ultimate Hybrid of Comfort and Tailored Style\n\nRedefine your everyday lineup with our Premium Textured Drawstring Trousers. Designed to bridge the gap between the relaxed feel of premium joggers and the clean lines of smart chinos, these trousers are a modern wardrobe essential. Crafted from a soft, finely ribbed textured fabric, they offer visual depth and exceptional all-day comfort.\n\nTailored in a contemporary Narrow Fit, they feature a flexible elastic waistband with a contrast adjustable drawstring, making them perfect for long workdays, weekend travel, or relaxed evening outings.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nPremium Textured Fabric: Made from a breathable, finely ribbed/corduroy-style material that provides a soft feel, durability, and a sophisticated matte finish.\nHybrid Comfort Waistband: Features a fully elasticated waistband paired with a contrast white drawstring (finished with premium square metal aglets) for a secure, custom fit.\nModern Narrow Fit: Tapers cleanly down the leg for a sharp, streamlined silhouette that pairs effortlessly with casual tees, knits, or sneakers.\nDistinctive Details: Includes deep front slant pockets with a small metallic accent charm, and dual rear patch pockets featuring a vintage-inspired \"19781\" heritage brand patch.\nVersatile Color Palette: Available in seven earthy and classic tones to easily mix and match with your wardrobe: Beige, Mocha Brown, Navy Blue, Light Grey, Classic Black, Dark Brown, and Olive Green.",
    "careInstructions": "To maintain the unique ribbed texture, color vibrancy, and elastic components, please follow these care guidelines:\n\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Do not hand scrub or dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: High heat will permanently flatten the textured fabric and damage the elastic waistband. If necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron on the reverse side, or use a gentle garment steamer.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade. Do not tumble dry on high heat.",
