    "name": "IMP - 009",
    "slug": "imp-009",
    "description": "Upgrade your travel wardrobe with our Travel Wear Edition Textured Drawstring Trousers (Style: IMP-009). Engineered specifically for the modern jet-setter and road-tripper, these hybrid trousers combine the relaxed, unrestricted feel of loungewear with the polished look of smart-casual chinos. Whether you're enduring a long-haul flight, navigating a busy terminal, or exploring a new city, you will arrive looking just as sharp as when you departed. They effortlessly pair with your favorite travel tees, hoodies, or casual button-downs, allowing you to pack lighter and wear more.\n\nProduct Highlights:\n\nPackable & Wrinkle-Forgiving: Crafted from a soft, breathable fabric with a sophisticated ribbed texture. This unique finish naturally hides creases, making them the perfect space-saving pants to roll into your carry-on or weekender bag.\nTransit Comfort Waistband: Designed for long hours of sitting, the highly adaptable elasticated waistband features standard belt loops and a contrast white adjustable drawstring for a secure, custom fit.\nModern Tailored Fit: Cut for a clean, streamlined silhouette that tapers gently down the leg, offering a sharp profile without feeling restrictive during travel.\nOn-the-Go Functionality: Equipped with deep, slanted side pockets to keep your boarding pass, phone, and travel essentials secure and easily accessible.",
    "careInstructions": "To maintain the unique textured finish, color richness, and elastic components, please adhere strictly to the following care guidelines:\n\nWASHING MACHINE ONLY: Wash on a gentle, cold cycle with similar colors. Perfect for easy, low-maintenance cleaning after your trip. Do not hand scrub harshly or dry clean.\nNO HOT IRONING: A major benefit for travelers—these trousers are designed to be worn without high-maintenance pressing. High heat will permanently damage the textured fibers and the elastic waistband. If absolutely necessary, use only a cool/low-temperature iron on the reverse side, or use a gentle garment steamer.\nDrying: Line dry in the shade to preserve the fabric's integrity. Do not tumble dry on high heat.",
